n/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":579,"digest":"sha256:567e353fab9254eeb0fe21bc7b91f051814e6da542adf78903fe8b8a02e7b4c8","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-28T19:05:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T19:05:52Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/alexfisenkov/MacDictate/releases/download/untagged-1dd51caa2c27791ef3ea/SHA256SUMS"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexfisenkov/MacDictate/releases/assets/686037265","id":686037265,"node_id":"RA_kwDOR166084o5BkR","name":"windows-build-manifest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"alexfisenkov","id":204082326,"node_id":"U_kgDODCoMlg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204082326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov","html_url":"https://github.com/alexfisenkov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1917,"digest":"sha256:3c9938a22345c81383a995ede87f73a17a522e838b174a76ca7b2ecd93b7eb39","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-28T19:05:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T19:05:52Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/alexfisenkov/MacDictate/releases/download/untagged-1dd51caa2c27791ef3ea/windows-build-manifest.json"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexfisenkov/MacDictate/releases/assets/686037276","id":686037276,"node_id":"RA_kwDOR166084o5Bkc","name":"WINDOWS-SHA256SUMS","label":"","uploader":{"login":"alexfisenkov","id":204082326,"node_id":"U_kgDODCoMlg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204082326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov","html_url":"https://github.com/alexfisenkov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexfisenkov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":202,"digest":"sha256:813fdf85e12a33f5bccf1503916514511566f366710b0a914ec3c08802cf7774","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-28T19:05:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T19:05:52Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/alexfisenkov/MacDictate/releases/download/untagged-1dd51caa2c27791ef3ea/WINDOWS-SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":null,"zipball_url":null,"body":"# MacDictate for Windows 1.6.1\n\nWindows-only update: a visible first-run window guides model setup, microphone checks, recording and the recognized text. Russian and English instructions, recovery actions and a Copy button are available in the main window. Model/settings and the last text are saved automatically. macOS remains at 1.6.0/build 14.\n\n## First dictation\n\n1. Download `MacDictate_Windows_v1.6.1_x64.exe` and install for your Windows user. For the portable option, unpack the entire ZIP and run `MacDictate.exe`; keep `runtime` beside it. .NET and Python do not need separate installation.\n2. Click **Start setup: download model** / **Начать настройку: скачать модель**. The approximately 488 MB model is checked and saved automatically; no Save button is needed. You can select an existing compatible Whisper ggml `.bin` model instead.\n3. Select an input and click **Test microphone** / **Проверить микрофон**; speak for three seconds and check the signal. If needed, open **Windows microphone privacy** and allow microphone access for desktop apps. Windows usually does not show a separate permission prompt for this desktop program. Return to MacDictate and test again.\n4. Click **Start recording**, speak, then **Stop and recognize**. Alternatively, press **left Alt twice** to start and twice again to stop. Right Alt/AltGr and key combinations do not start dictation. Keep the button available as a fallback.\n5. Wait for local recognition, then use **Copy text** / **Копировать текст**, or use guarded automatic insertion from your editor. Closing the window keeps the tray app running; reopen it from the tray or launch MacDictate again. The last text stays available until replaced or explicitly cleared.\n\n## Installation and data\n\nThe x64 packages are self-contained and **unsigned**. Check the downloaded SHA-256 against `WINDOWS-SHA256SUMS` from this release. SmartScreen/Smart App Control or organization policy can limit installation; do not disable Windows protection. Existing settings/models are preserved; an existing different-hash model is not silently replaced. Move that file aside or select a working model before retrying.\n\nAudio recognition runs locally through bundled Whisper on CPU. The model is downloaded only after an explicit action. Last text is stored locally; manual Copy uses the Windows clipboard and its optional history/sync settings.\n\n## What was checked\n\n[Final CI 40747430459](https://github.com/alexfisenkov/MacDictate/actions/runs/40747430459) passed all three jobs for source `56b45301bc0e98c12f4823e5039152a3c3dd5229`. Windows Server 2025 checks covered 62 portable tests, native hook/paste/clipboard safety, one real bundled Whisper recognition of a synthetic spoken fixture, visible text/Copy and clipboard read-back, normal fresh installed launch/reopen, all 492 payload files and preservation of synthetic settings/model/last text through reinstall/uninstall.\n\nCapture PCM and onboarding key activation used explicit synthetic test seams. Populated installed UI used synthetic persisted text and actual UIA/clipboard checks. Synthetic 125/150% layout stress passed at actual desktop DPI 96. Physical Windows 10/11 microphone/Alt/editor, native monitor 125/150%, GUI model HTTP-success path and interactive installer/SmartScreen acceptance remain **NOT_RUN**. One populated installed PNG was not retained; its UIA/clipboard checks passed, and a separate real-ASR result PNG was inspected.\n\n## Packages\n\n| File | Bytes | SHA-256 |\n|---|---:|---|\n| `MacDictate_Windows_v1.6.1_x64.exe` | 54351051 | `fe85fd784649f057d16a115392b3c09cb7ceaf42e8f59beefc05d8149b3307e9` |\n| `MacDictate_Windows_v1.6.1_x64.zip` | 77339968 | `55eedeed0bda8e91dc807cab00fefc9041e5c3d1151984508107e1e287c6365d` |\n"}